  file_change {
    absolute_path_uri: "file:///README.md"
    file_change_type: FILE_CHANGE_TYPE_CREATE
    replacement_chunks {
      replacement_content: "# CraftDocs \342\200\224 A Minecraft-Themed Document Editor\n\nCraftDocs is a document editor that blends Google Docs (continuous linear WYSIWYG) and Notion (reorderable block-based structure), wrapped entirely in a **Minecraft pixel-art UI theme**.\n\n## \342\232\224\357\270\217 Architecture & Design Decisions\n\n### 1. Dual Paradigm Mode Switching\n- **Survival Mode (Google Docs)**: A continuous `contenteditable` canvas powered by browser Selection API and `document.execCommand` for linear editing.\n- **Creative Mode (Notion Blocks)**: A block-based editor where each element (paragraph, heading, quote, code, list item, image) is an individual, draggable `Block` component.\n- **Lossless Conversion**: Switching between modes converts the active page between `Block[]` and HTML seamlessly using a custom DOM parser/converter (`/src/utils/converter.ts`). Content is never lost.\n\n### 2. Block Data Model\n```typescript\ninterface Block {\n  id: string;\n  type: \'text\' | \'heading1\' | \'heading2\' | \'heading3\' | \'bulletList\' | \'numberedList\' | \'quote\' | \'code\' | \'divider\' | \'image\';\n  content: string;\n}\n\ninterface Page {\n  id: string;\n  title: string;\n  icon?: string;\n  parentId?: string | null;\n  blocks: Block[];\n  createdAt: number;\n  updatedAt: number;\n}\n```\n\n### 3. LocalStorage Persistence Strategy\n- All documents, nested page hierarchies, and editor mode preferences auto-sync to `localStorage`.\n- Background auto-save triggers every 30 seconds or on edit debounces, updating the Minecraft XP status bar with live `SAVING...` / `SAVED` states.\n\n### 4. Minecraft UI Theme System\n- **Fonts**: `Press Start 2P` for pixel chrome, UI buttons, and labels. `Courier Prime` for document body text.\n- **Top Hotbar**: Stone texture background (`mc-stone-bg`) with 48\303\22748px square inventory slots (`mc-slot`) and golden hover glows.\n- **Enchanted Item Mode Toggle**: Creative mode toggle features custom `@keyframes` CSS shimmer animation.\n- **Inventory Sidebar**: Dark Oak Wood plank texture (`mc-oak-wood-bg`) with nested tree structures and drag-and-drop hierarchy.\n- **Parchment Canvas**: Book & Quill parchment texture background with brown pixel border (`mc-parchment-bg`).\n- **XP Status Bar**: Green XP fill bar tracking live word count.\n- **Achievement Notifications**: Slide-in Minecraft achievement popup cards.\n\n## \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Getting Started\n\n```bash\n# Install dependencies\nnpm install\n\n# Run local development server\nnpm run dev\n\n# Build production bundle\nnpm run build\n```\n"
    }
