    response: "I have completed **CraftDocs**, a Minecraft-themed document editor web application combining Survival (Google Docs WYSIWYG) and Creative (Notion block-based) editing paradigms.\n\n### \342\234\250 Key Features Implemented\n\n- **Mode Switching Engine**:\n  - **\342\232\224\357\270\217 Survival Mode**: Continuous linear document editing powered by browser Selection API formatting (Bold, Italic, Underline, Headings, Lists, Links, Images).\n  - **\360\237\247\261 Creative Mode**: Reorderable block-based editor. Each paragraph, heading, list, quote, code block, or image is a draggable block with custom HTML5 drag-and-drop handles.\n  - **Lossless Conversion**: Seamlessly converts content back and forth between continuous HTML and `Block[]` structures without data loss.\n\n- **Minecraft UI Aesthetics & Textures**:\n  - **Typographic Pairings**: Integrated `Press Start 2P` font for pixel UI chrome and hotbar slots, with `Courier Prime` for document body readability.\n  - **Hotbar Toolbar**: Styled as a stone cobblestone bar with 48\303\22748px square inventory slots (`mc-slot`), golden hover outlines, and active slot glowing highlights.\n  - **Enchanted Mode Button**: Animated purple CSS shimmer keyframes for Creative Mode.\n  - **Dark Oak Inventory Sidebar**: Textured dark oak wood panel with nested parent/child page trees, drag-and-drop page nesting, search filtering, and a crafting table `+ NEW PAGE` button.\n  - **Slash `/` Crafting Menu**: Floating chat-style modal for quick block insertion (Text, Headings, Lists, Quotes, Redstone Code, Dividers, Images).\n  - **XP Progress Bar & Status**: Full-width bottom status bar tracking live word count as a Minecraft XP fill bar with level badges, auto-save status, and Creeper indicator.\n  - **Achievement Toasts**: Slide-in achievement popup notifications for milestones (e.g., *Achievement Unlocked: Creative Crafting!*).\n\n- **Data Persistence**:\n  - Automatic `localStorage` persistence for pages, nested hierarchies, and active editor preferences with a 30-second background auto-save system."
    thinking: "**Reviewing Our Progress**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the `compile_applet` process completed successfully, free of errors! Now, I\'m meticulously reviewing the implementation to ensure it meets every requirement outlined in the prompt. I\'m starting with the foundational elements: the name, CraftDocs, and the Minecraft-themed aesthetic, followed by the chosen framework.\n\n\n**Defining Core Features**\n\nI\'ve got the foundational React + TypeScript setup with Vite and Tailwind CSS ready to go. Now, I\'m focusing on the editor\'s core: a bespoke implementation. The plan is for Survival Mode, Google Docs style, using `contenteditable` and the Selection API; Creative Mode will employ custom Block components and HTML5 Drag & Drop. I\'m also ensuring lossless mode conversion. Finally, I\'m integrating the Minecraft UI theming including fonts and top toolbar elements.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed **CraftDocs**, a Minecraft-themed document editor web application combining Survival (Google Docs WYSIWYG) and Creative (Notion block-based) editing paradigms.\n\n### \342\234\250 Key Features Implemented\n\n- **Mode Switching Engine**:\n  - **\342\232\224\357\270\217 Survival Mode**: Continuous linear document editing powered by browser Selection API formatting (Bold, Italic, Underline, Headings, Lists, Links, Images).\n  - **\360\237\247\261 Creative Mode**: Reorderable block-based editor. Each paragraph, heading, list, quote, code block, or image is a draggable block with custom HTML5 drag-and-drop handles.\n  - **Lossless Conversion**: Seamlessly converts content back and forth between continuous HTML and `Block[]` structures without data loss.\n\n- **Minecraft UI Aesthetics & Textures**:\n  - **Typographic Pairings**: Integrated `Press Start 2P` font for pixel UI chrome and hotbar slots, with `Courier Prime` for document body readability.\n  - **Hotbar Toolbar**: Styled as a stone cobblestone bar with 48\303\22748px square inventory slots (`mc-slot`), golden hover outlines, and active slot glowing highlights.\n  - **Enchanted Mode Button**: Animated purple CSS shimmer keyframes for Creative Mode.\n  - **Dark Oak Inventory Sidebar**: Textured dark oak wood panel with nested parent/child page trees, drag-and-drop page nesting, search filtering, and a crafting table `+ NEW PAGE` button.\n  - **Slash `/` Crafting Menu**: Floating chat-style modal for quick block insertion (Text, Headings, Lists, Quotes, Redstone Code, Dividers, Images).\n  - **XP Progress Bar & Status**: Full-width bottom status bar tracking live word count as a Minecraft XP fill bar with level badges, auto-save status, and Creeper indicator.\n  - **Achievement Toasts**: Slide-in achievement popup notifications for milestones (e.g., *Achievement Unlocked: Creative Crafting!*).\n\n- **Data Persistence**:\n  - Automatic `localStorage` persistence for pages, nested hierarchies, and active editor preferences with a 30-second background auto-save system."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 797027124
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
