  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\'flex flex-col h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#1e1e1e] font-mono overflow-hidden select-none\' style=\'background-color: #1e1e1e; border: 4px solid #000;\'>\\n  <header class=\'h-16 flex items-center justify-between px-4 z-20\' style=\'background-color: #3f3f3f; border-bottom: 4px solid #111; background-image: radial-gradient(#4a4a4a 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 4px 4px;\'>\\n    <div class=\'flex items-center gap-1\'>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\342\232\224\357\270\217</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\360\237\223\234</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\360\237\252\250</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\360\237\247\261</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\360\237\223\213</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\360\237\222\216</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4\'>\\n      <div class=\'text-[#FFD700] text-xs font-bold tracking-tighter\'>CraftDocs v1.0</div>\\n      <button class=\'px-4 py-2 border-4 border-[#555] bg-[#2d2d2d] text-white text-[10px] flex items-center gap-2\' style=\'box-shadow: inset -2px -2px 0 #111;\'>\\n        <span>\360\237\247\261</span> CREATIVE MODE\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\'flex flex-1 overflow-hidden\'>\\n    <aside class=\'w-64 flex flex-col p-4\' style=\'background-color: #3b2a1a; background-image: linear-gradient(#2e2012 4px, transparent 0); background-size: 100% 8px; border-right: 4px solid #111;\'>\\n      <h2 class=\'text-[#FFD700] text-xs mb-6 uppercase tracking-widest\'>\360\237\223\232 Inventory</h2>\\n      <nav class=\'space-y-1 flex-1\'>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-black/30 border-l-4 border-[#FFD700]\'>\\n          <span class=\'text-sm\'>\360\237\223\204</span>\\n          <span class=\'text-white text-[10px]\'>Exploration_Log.md</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 p-2 hover:bg-white/10\'>\\n          <span class=\'text-sm opacity-50\'>\360\237\223\204</span>\\n          <span class=\'text-white/60 text-[10px]\'>Stronghold_Coords.txt</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 p-2 hover:bg-white/10\'>\\n          <span class=\'text-sm opacity-50\'>\360\237\223\204</span>\\n          <span class=\'text-white/60 text-[10px]\'>Recipes_Potions.doc</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 p-2 hover:bg-white/10\'>\\n          <span class=\'text-sm opacity-50\'>\360\237\223\201</span>\\n          <span class=\'text-white/60 text-[10px]\'>Archive</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </nav>\\n      <button class=\'mt-auto py-3 bg-[#4c7c3c] border-4 border-t-[#7eb063] border-l-[#7eb063] border-r-[#2d4c22] border-b-[#2d4c22] text-white text-[10px]\'>\\n        + NEW PAGE\\n      </button>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <main class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col bg-[#111] p-8 items-center justify-start relative\'>\\n      <div class=\'absolute top-4 right-4 bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-[#FFD700] p-3 flex gap-4 items-center animate-bounce\' style=\'box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;\'>\\n        <div class=\'w-10 h-10 bg-[#FFD700] flex items-center justify-center text-xl\'>\360\237\217\206</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\'text-[#FFD700] text-[8px] uppercase\'>Achievement Get!</div>\\n          <div class=\'text-white text-[10px]\'>First Paragraph</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\'w-full max-w-2xl h-full flex flex-col p-12 bg-[#fdf6e3] border-[6px] border-[#8B6914]\' style=\'box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\'>\\n        <h1 class=\'text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-[#2b2b2b] mb-8 border-b-2 border-black/10 pb-2\'>The End City Expedition</h1>\\n        <div class=\'flex-1 font-serif text-lg text-[#3b3b3b] leading-relaxed relative\'>\\n          <p class=\'mb-6\'>I have finally found the stronghold after traversing the frozen tundra for three days. The eyes of ender were jittery, leading me directly beneath a small village. The stone brick walls are crumbling, yet the portal room remains intact.</p>\\n          <p class=\'mb-6\'>Survival Checklist:</p>\\n          <ul class=\'list-disc pl-6 mb-6\'>\\n            <li>Diamond Armor (Protection IV)</li>\\n            <li>Infinity Bow & Sharpness V Sword</li>\\n            <li>Two buckets of water for the fall</li>\\n            <li>Plenty of baked potatoes</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 opacity-50 mt-12\'>\\n             <span class=\'w-0.5 h-6 bg-black animate-pulse\'></span>\\n             <span class=\'text-sm italic\'>Ready to edit...</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\'absolute bottom-12 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-80 bg-[#1a1a2e] border-2 border-[#3f3f3f] p-2\' style=\'box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\'>\\n        <div class=\'text-[#3a5fcd] text-[8px] mb-2 uppercase\'>/ Commands</div>\\n        <div class=\'space-y-1\'>\\n          <div class=\'bg-[#3a5fcd] text-white p-1 text-[9px] flex items-center justify-between\'>\\n            <span>\360\237\247\261 Heading 1</span>\\n            <span class=\'opacity-50\'>Enter</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'text-white/70 p-1 text-[9px] hover:bg-white/10\'>\360\237\223\234 Italic Text</div>\\n          <div class=\'text-white/70 p-1 text-[9px] hover:bg-white/10\'>\360\237\223\213 Bullet List</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <footer class=\'h-10 bg-[#111] flex items-center px-4 justify-between border-t-4 border-black\'>\\n    <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 flex-1 max-w-md\'>\\n      <div class=\'text-[#3f3f3f] text-[10px] font-bold\'>LVL 12</div>\\n      <div class=\'flex-1 h-2 bg-[#2d2d2d] border border-black relative\'>\\n        <div class=\'absolute left-0 top-0 h-full bg-[#7cfc00]\' style=\'width: 24.7%; box-shadow: 0 0 10px #7cfc00;\'></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\'text-[#7cfc00] text-[10px] font-bold shadow-green-900\'>247 WORDS</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 ml-8\'>\\n      <div class=\'text-white/40 text-[9px] tracking-widest\'>\360\237\222\276 LAST SAVED: 12:44 PM</div>\\n      <div class=\'text-xl\'>\360\237\221\276</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\'flex flex-col h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#1e1e1e] font-mono overflow-hidden select-none\' style=\'background-color: #1e1e1e; border: 4px solid #000;\'>\\n  <header class=\'h-16 flex items-center justify-between px-4 z-20\' style=\'background-color: #3f3f3f; border-bottom: 4px solid #111; background-image: radial-gradient(#4a4a4a 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 4px 4px;\'>\\n    <div class=\'flex items-center gap-1\'>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\342\232\224\357\270\217</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\360\237\223\234</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\360\237\252\250</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\360\237\247\261</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\360\237\223\213</div>\\n      <div class=\'w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-t-[#555] border-l-[#555] border-r-[#111] border-b-[#111] hover:border-[#FFD700] cursor-pointer\'>\360\237\222\216</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4\'>\\n      <div class=\'text-[#FFD700] text-xs font-bold tracking-tighter\'>CraftDocs v1.0</div>\\n      <button class=\'px-4 py-2 border-4 border-[#555] bg-[#2d2d2d] text-white text-[10px] flex items-center gap-2\' style=\'box-shadow: inset -2px -2px 0 #111;\'>\\n        <span>\360\237\247\261</span> CREATIVE MODE\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <div class=\'flex flex-1 overflow-hidden\'>\\n    <aside class=\'w-64 flex flex-col p-4\' style=\'background-color: #3b2a1a; background-image: linear-gradient(#2e2012 4px, transparent 0); background-size: 100% 8px; border-right: 4px solid #111;\'>\\n      <h2 class=\'text-[#FFD700] text-xs mb-6 uppercase tracking-widest\'>\360\237\223\232 Inventory</h2>\\n      <nav class=\'space-y-1 flex-1\'>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 p-2 bg-black/30 border-l-4 border-[#FFD700]\'>\\n          <span class=\'text-sm\'>\360\237\223\204</span>\\n          <span class=\'text-white text-[10px]\'>Exploration_Log.md</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 p-2 hover:bg-white/10\'>\\n          <span class=\'text-sm opacity-50\'>\360\237\223\204</span>\\n          <span class=\'text-white/60 text-[10px]\'>Stronghold_Coords.txt</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 p-2 hover:bg-white/10\'>\\n          <span class=\'text-sm opacity-50\'>\360\237\223\204</span>\\n          <span class=\'text-white/60 text-[10px]\'>Recipes_Potions.doc</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 p-2 hover:bg-white/10\'>\\n          <span class=\'text-sm opacity-50\'>\360\237\223\201</span>\\n          <span class=\'text-white/60 text-[10px]\'>Archive</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </nav>\\n      <button class=\'mt-auto py-3 bg-[#4c7c3c] border-4 border-t-[#7eb063] border-l-[#7eb063] border-r-[#2d4c22] border-b-[#2d4c22] text-white text-[10px]\'>\\n        + NEW PAGE\\n      </button>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <main class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col bg-[#111] p-8 items-center justify-start relative\'>\\n      <div class=\'absolute top-4 right-4 bg-[#2d2d2d] border-4 border-[#FFD700] p-3 flex gap-4 items-center animate-bounce\' style=\'box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;\'>\\n        <div class=\'w-10 h-10 bg-[#FFD700] flex items-center justify-center text-xl\'>\360\237\217\206</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div class=\'text-[#FFD700] text-[8px] uppercase\'>Achievement Get!</div>\\n          <div class=\'text-white text-[10px]\'>First Paragraph</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\'w-full max-w-2xl h-full flex flex-col p-12 bg-[#fdf6e3] border-[6px] border-[#8B6914]\' style=\'box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\'>\\n        <h1 class=\'text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-[#2b2b2b] mb-8 border-b-2 border-black/10 pb-2\'>The End City Expedition</h1>\\n        <div class=\'flex-1 font-serif text-lg text-[#3b3b3b] leading-relaxed relative\'>\\n          <p class=\'mb-6\'>I have finally found the stronghold after traversing the frozen tundra for three days. The eyes of ender were jittery, leading me directly beneath a small village. The stone brick walls are crumbling, yet the portal room remains intact.</p>\\n          <p class=\'mb-6\'>Survival Checklist:</p>\\n          <ul class=\'list-disc pl-6 mb-6\'>\\n            <li>Diamond Armor (Protection IV)</li>\\n            <li>Infinity Bow & Sharpness V Sword</li>\\n            <li>Two buckets of water for the fall</li>\\n            <li>Plenty of baked potatoes</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 opacity-50 mt-12\'>\\n             <span class=\'w-0.5 h-6 bg-black animate-pulse\'></span>\\n             <span class=\'text-sm italic\'>Ready to edit...</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\'absolute bottom-12 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-80 bg-[#1a1a2e] border-2 border-[#3f3f3f] p-2\' style=\'box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\'>\\n        <div class=\'text-[#3a5fcd] text-[8px] mb-2 uppercase\'>/ Commands</div>\\n        <div class=\'space-y-1\'>\\n          <div class=\'bg-[#3a5fcd] text-white p-1 text-[9px] flex items-center justify-between\'>\\n            <span>\360\237\247\261 Heading 1</span>\\n            <span class=\'opacity-50\'>Enter</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'text-white/70 p-1 text-[9px] hover:bg-white/10\'>\360\237\223\234 Italic Text</div>\\n          <div class=\'text-white/70 p-1 text-[9px] hover:bg-white/10\'>\360\237\223\213 Bullet List</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </main>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <footer class=\'h-10 bg-[#111] flex items-center px-4 justify-between border-t-4 border-black\'>\\n    <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 flex-1 max-w-md\'>\\n      <div class=\'text-[#3f3f3f] text-[10px] font-bold\'>LVL 12</div>\\n      <div class=\'flex-1 h-2 bg-[#2d2d2d] border border-black relative\'>\\n        <div class=\'absolute left-0 top-0 h-full bg-[#7cfc00]\' style=\'width: 24.7%; box-shadow: 0 0 10px #7cfc00;\'></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\'text-[#7cfc00] text-[10px] font-bold shadow-green-900\'>247 WORDS</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 ml-8\'>\\n      <div class=\'text-white/40 text-[9px] tracking-widest\'>\360\237\222\276 LAST SAVED: 12:44 PM</div>\\n      <div class=\'text-xl\'>\360\237\221\276</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
