  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing UI Components**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on developing the necessary UI elements. I\'ve started fleshing out the `SignupModal` component, which will handle character selection, username input, character preview, and theme preferences. In addition to that, the plan is to move on to constructing `MinecraftCompanion` to host our persistent Steve or Alex element.\n\n\n**Designing Companion UI**\n\nI\'m now thinking about the UI elements for the companion. I envision animated SVG sprites for Steve and Alex, with different states. There will be click interactions to open a dialog with features, including an interactive tutorial, day/night mode toggle, Minecraft pro tips, and a fun \"SPAWN CREEPER\" button. The Creeper button is intended to be a complete screen destroyer, as it clears the screen and creates a visually appealing explosion. I will use a separate component to manage the visual and sound effects of the creeper explosion.\n\n\n**Adding Toolbar Features**\n\nI\'ve been working on the toolbar, and it\'s getting a serious upgrade. I\'m adding comprehensive text formatting options \342\200\223 bold, italic, and all the rest. I\'m implementing color pickers with Minecraft-inspired palettes, and alignment controls. I am also working on insert options with plenty of interactive options, including todo lists, callout boxes, and even a crafting grid. I plan to incorporate Undo/Redo buttons, a clear formatting option, and a fullscreen toggle. I\'m updating other components to support this as well.\n\n\n"
