  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Toolbar Enhancements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing `src/components/Toolbar.tsx`. My primary goal is to implement clearer tool visibility and user-friendly labels. I\'m thinking of incorporating tool groups akin to Minecraft\'s hotbar, with dividers for better organization. I\'m also planning to add some Google Docs and Notion features.\n\n\n**Expanding Toolbar Functions**\n\nI\'ve been mapping out specific functionalities for the toolbar. The current focus includes history actions (undo, redo, clear formatting) and a complete suite of text formatting options. I\'m also planning to incorporate headings (H1-H3, normal text) and color options inspired by the Minecraft dye palette, for both text and highlights. Alignment tools are next, and I\'m currently conceptualizing insert tools like bulleted lists, numbered lists, and even a crafting table grid, and other tools.\n\n\n"
