    response: "I have updated **CraftDocs** to deliver a complete Google Docs document editor experience, defaulting to **White A4 Paper** while preserving the Minecraft theme.\n\n### Key Enhancements Implemented:\n\n- **White A4 Default & Page Setup Modal**:\n  - Configured **White A4 (210 \303\227 297 mm)** as the standard document format with high-contrast typography and authentic page dimensions.\n  - Added the **Page Setup Modal** (`File \342\206\222 Page setup...` or the top bar chip) to customize paper sizes (**A4**, **Letter**, **Legal**, **Book & Quill**, **Pageless Canvas**, **Tabloid**), orientation (**Portrait** / **Landscape**), margins (**Normal**, **Narrow**, **Wide**, **Compact**), and paper color themes (**White**, **Ivory**, **Parchment**, **Obsidian**, **Void**).\n\n- **Google Docs Interactive Menu Bar**:\n  - Integrated standard dropdown menus: **File**, **Edit**, **View**, **Insert**, **Format**, **Tools**, and **Help**.\n  - **Export Suite**: Export documents to **PDF (Print)**, **Plain Text (.txt)**, **Markdown (.md)**, **HTML (.html)**, or **JSON Backup**.\n  - **Find & Replace**: Interactive search and batch replacement tool with case matching.\n  - **Word Count**: Real-time stats dialog for pages, words, characters (with/without spaces), reading time, and Minecraft XP levels.\n  - **Special Characters & Glyphs**: Palette for Minecraft items/icons, typographical symbols, arrows, and math notations.\n\n- **Google Docs Ruler & Formatting Strip**:\n  - Added the **Document Ruler** positioned above the page canvas with margin indicators.\n  - Expanded the action toolbar with Font Family selection, font size steppers, paragraph styles (Heading 1-3, Quote, Code), line spacing options (1.0, 1.15, 1.5, 2.0), alignment, lists, indent controls, dye colors, and potion highlights.\n\n- **Dual-Engine Sync & Animated Companion**:\n  - Seamless synchronization between **Survival Mode** (continuous Google Docs layout) and **Creative Mode** (Notion drag-and-drop blocks).\n  - Full-body **Steve / Alex** companion assistant in the corner providing tutorials, Overworld Day / Nether Night switching, and Creeper detonation."
