    response: "I have completed the full implementation of CraftDocs with all requested features, authentic Minecraft styling, and Google Docs / Notion functionality:\n\n- **Minecraft Document Hub Home Page**:\n  - **Panoramic Animated Background**: A live voxel landscape featuring animated sun/moon orbits, clouds, grass hills, and day/night lighting.\n  - **Dynamic Splash Text**: Classic Minecraft title with bouncing yellow splash text.\n  - **Template Carousel & Hub**: One-click creation for Blank A4 Parchment, Quest Logs, Alchemy Codexes, Redstone Schematics, and Meeting Minutes.\n  - **Category Tabs & Search**: Filter documents by *All*, *Recent*, *Starred*, *Shared*, *Google Drive*, and *Trash*, with instant search and grid/list view toggles.\n\n- **Steve & Alex Peeking AI Companions**:\n  - **Full Animated Character Model**: The complete character body peeks from the bottom right with idle breathing, walking bob, and hand-waving animations.\n  - **Interactive Companion Dialogue**: Offers navigation assistance, day/night mode toggles, Minecraft lore trivia, and the ability to summon an animated Creeper explosion to detonate the parchment.\n  - **Character Selection**: Choose between Steve or Alex during signup or switch anytime from the user profile menu.\n\n- **Identifiable Toolbar Buttons with Labels**:\n  - Each toolbar tool now features a visible pixel-art label beneath its icon (**UNDO**, **REDO**, **PRINT**, **ZOOM**, **STYLE**, **FONT**, **SIZE**, **BOLD**, **ITALIC**, **UNDER**, **STRIKE**, **COLOR**, **GLOW**, **ALIGN**, **LIST**, **INDENT**, **LINK**, **IMAGE**, **GLYPH**, **CLEAR**).\n  - Includes a dedicated toggle button to switch between labeled mode and compact mode.\n\n- **Google Drive Linking & Cloud Sync**:\n  - Dedicated Google Drive modal to link accounts, back up the active parchment to Google Drive, and import Drive documents directly into the editor.\n\n- **Share Realm Modal**:\n  - Document sharing dialog with granular permissions (*View