    thinking: "**Considering Menu Bar Components**\n\nI\'ve been working on defining the structure for a Google Docs menu bar. I\'ve introduced `uiDensity` and `onChangeUiDensity` props for flexible layout. Now, I am considering the different layouts needed for different densities. For \'compact\' density, I have planned a single-row layout that will have a Home button, a title input, a star icon, and inline dropdown menus.\n\n\n"
