  planner_response {
    response: "I have performed a thorough audit across all UI components, buttons, and state handlers in CraftDocs to ensure everything operates smoothly and reliably for publication:\n\n- **Template & Document Creation**: Fixed `createPage` in the core state engine to properly retain and clone initial block hierarchies when creating new documents from templates or importing from external files.\n- **Realm Sharing & Collaboration**: Connected `updatePageShareSettings` to the Share Modal to ensure public access toggles (Viewer/Editor permissions) and invite lists persist directly to the document and local storage.\n- **AI Block Insertion**: Corrected the Gemini assistant\'s Creative Mode insert handler to generate valid `text` blocks rather than unsupported block types.\n- **Toolbar & Menu System**: Verified all formatting buttons (Bold, Italic, Underline, Lists, Alignments, Headings, Code blocks, and Special Glyphs) work seamlessly in both **Survival Mode** (Google Docs WYSIWYG) and **Creative Mode** (Notion drag-and-drop blocks).\n- **Interactive Triggers & Easter Eggs**: Verified the Creeper animation event in the Tools menu properly mounts and triggers the explosion sequence with safe rollback.\n- **Full Production Build Verification**: Passed all TypeScript type checks (`tsc --noEmit`) and Vite production bundle builds cleanly."
    modified_response: "I have performed a thorough audit across all UI components, buttons, and state handlers in CraftDocs to ensure everything operates smoothly and reliably for publication:\n\n- **Template & Document Creation**: Fixed `createPage` in the core state engine to properly retain and clone initial block hierarchies when creating new documents from templates or importing from external files.\n- **Realm Sharing & Collaboration**: Connected `updatePageShareSettings` to the Share Modal to ensure public access toggles (Viewer/Editor permissions) and invite lists persist directly to the document and local storage.\n- **AI Block Insertion**: Corrected the Gemini assistant\'s Creative Mode insert handler to generate valid `text` blocks rather than unsupported block types.\n- **Toolbar & Menu System**: Verified all formatting buttons (Bold, Italic, Underline, Lists, Alignments, Headings, Code blocks, and Special Glyphs) work seamlessly in both **Survival Mode** (Google Docs WYSIWYG) and **Creative Mode** (Notion drag-and-drop blocks).\n- **Interactive Triggers & Easter Eggs**: Verified the Creeper animation event in the Tools menu properly mounts and triggers the explosion sequence with safe rollback.\n- **Full Production Build Verification**: Passed all TypeScript type checks (`tsc --noEmit`) and Vite production bundle builds cleanly."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
