  file_change {
    absolute_path_uri: "file:///README.md"
    file_change_type: FILE_CHANGE_TYPE_CREATE
    replacement_chunks {
      replacement_content: "# CraftDocs \342\232\224\357\270\217\360\237\223\234 \342\200\224 Minecraft-Themed Document Editor\n\nA rich, pixel-art document crafting application blending **Google Docs** (Survival Mode WYSIWYG) and **Notion** (Creative Mode Drag-and-Drop Blocks) with seamless real-time dual-paradigm conversion.\n\n![CraftDocs Banner](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1627856013091-fed6e4e30025?w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80)\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\214\237 Key Features\n\n### \342\232\224\357\270\217 Dual Paradigm Editing\n- **Survival Mode (Google Docs)**: Seamless continuous parchment canvas with selection formatting, paragraph styles, text color picker, highlight highlighter, alignments, lists, image/link insertion, ruler, and print support.\n- **Creative Mode (Notion Blocks)**: Modular block-based workspace with slash commands (`/`), drag-and-drop reordering, interactive to-do checkboxes, code blocks, quote blocks, and callouts.\n- **Lossless Instant Conversion**: Switch seamlessly between Survival and Creative modes anytime without losing format or hierarchy.\n\n### \360\237\223\232 Inventory & Document Management\n- **Hierarchical Document Tree**: Organize notes with parent/child sub-pages, drag-and-drop nesting, duplication, and lava drop (deletion).\n- **Flexible UI Density**:\n  - **\342\232\241 Compact**: Sleek single-row toolstrip maximizing document workspace.\n  - **\360\237\223\220 Standard**: Classic multi-tier Google Docs menu bar with File, Edit, View, Insert, Format, and Tools dropdowns.\n  - **\360\237\221\201\357\270\217 Zen Focus**: Distraction-free parchment canvas hiding all toolbars.\n- **Sidebar Modes**: Collapsible mini icon rail (`~44px`), full tree drawer, or completely hidden.\n\n### \360\237\224\256 Enchanted Tools & Productivity\n- **\342\234\250 Gemini AI Enchantment**: Server-side AI assistant for spellchecking, proofreading, text summarization, tone enhancement, and lore expansion.\n- **\342\230\201\357\270\217 Google Drive & Cloud Sync**: Export and sync your documents with Google Drive or download directly as **PDF**, **Markdown (.md)**, **Plain Text (.txt)**, **HTML**, or **JSON backup**.\n- **\360\237\216\250 Customization**: Minecraft character skin avatars, retro CRT filter toggles, background music/sound effects, custom margin/page setup (A4, Letter, Legal, Tabloid), and Minecraft special glyphs.\n- **\360\237\247\250 Easter Eggs & Achievements**: In-game toast achievements and secret Creeper explosion tools.\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\232\200 Quick Start\n\n### 1. Clone & Install Dependencies\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/avanishkasar/CraftDocs.git\ncd CraftDocs\nnpm install\n```\n\n### 2. Configure Environment (Optional)\nIf using the Gemini AI features locally, create a `.env` file:\n```env\nGEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here\n```\n\n### 3. Run Development Server\n```bash\nnpm run dev\n```\nOpen [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) in your browser.\n\n### 4. Build for Production\n```bash\nnpm run build\n```\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\214\220 Deploy to GitHub Pages\n\nTo deploy the client-side SPA to GitHub Pages:\n\n1. In `package.json`, ensure your homepage matches your repository:\n   ```json\n   \"homepage\": \"https://avanishkasar.github.io/CraftDocs\"\n   ```\n2. Build the project:\n   ```bash\n   npm run build\n   ```\n3. Push to your `gh-pages` branch or configure GitHub Actions workflow.\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\233\240\357\270\217 Tech Stack\n\n- **Framework**: React 18+ & TypeScript\n- **Bundler & Dev Server**: Vite & Express / TSX\n- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS with custom Minecraft pixel-art themes (`Press Start 2P`, `Courier Prime`)\n- **Icons**: Lucide React\n- **AI Integration**: Google GenAI SDK (`@google/genai`)\n\n---\n\n## \360\237\223\234 License\nMIT License. Created with \342\235\244\357\270\217 and Redstone.\n"
    }
    diff {
      end_line: 55
      unified_diff {
        lines {
          text: "# CraftDocs \342\200\224 A Minecraft-Themed Document Editor"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          text: "CraftDocs is a document editor that blends Google Docs (continuous linear WYSIWYG) and Notion (reorderable block-based structure), wrapped entirely in a **Minecraft pixel-art UI theme**."
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
        }
        lines {
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
